---
title: "Juvenile Delinquency"
code: "SOC-235"
category: "sociology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Studies demographic trends, casual theories and control of juvenile delinquency. Presents juveniles’ interaction with family, school, police, courts, treatment programs, and facilities. Also approved for ADJ juvenile curriculum. Lecture 3 hours per week.
